{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_19105340","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19105340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1910534001:1":{"text":"瞧……瞧！咱碰到光了！","source_cn":"瞧……瞧！咱碰到光了！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x28C9DDBF5C95CFA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910534002:1":{"text":"这鬼玩意对咱没影响！","source_cn":"这鬼玩意对咱没影响！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xAACE43E2EC578ED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1910534002":{"text":"这鬼玩意对咱没影响！","source_cn":"这鬼玩意对咱没影响！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xAACE43E2EC578ED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910534003:1":{"text":"你的手轻而易举穿透了水波，光点在海水中上下飞旋，仿若在...","source_cn":"你的手轻而易举穿透了水波，光点在海水中上下飞旋，仿若在...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910534004:1":{"text":"你眨眨眼，看着在潮光中的自己的手。它仍是实体，坚定而平稳。","source_cn":"你眨眨眼，看着在潮光中的自己的手。它仍是实体，坚定而平稳。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x7FA20BF46B1EB4D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910534005:1":{"text":"你点头示意，这次大胆的尝试已经足够成功。","source_cn":"你点头示意，这次大胆的尝试已经足够成功。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x1B67F60AA0D7B2C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910534006:1":{"text":"随着图澜抽回手，你深吸一口气，挥动指尖。保护罩的缺口边...","source_cn":"随着图澜抽回手，你深吸一口气，挥动指尖。保护罩的缺口边...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1910534006":{"text":"随着图澜抽回手，你深吸一口气，挥动指尖。保护罩的缺口边缘如流质般延伸、缩小……直至完全复原，再次将潮光与塔拉萨隔绝开。","source_cn":"随着图澜抽回手，你深吸一口气，挥动指尖。保护罩的缺口边缘如流质般延伸、缩小……直至完全复原，再次将潮光与塔拉萨隔绝开。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x7C50EC9ED0209147","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910534008:1":{"text":"要是早知道这点，咱就不会让沫霖姐出事了。","source_cn":"要是早知道这点，咱就不会让沫霖姐出事了。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x7DBF18F34D889227","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910534009:1":{"text":"咱当时，本来能救下更多人……！混蛋！混蛋！","source_cn":"咱当时，本来能救下更多人……！混蛋！混蛋！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xADE6AE18E5CB76EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13: